  "instance_name": "bomb_disarmament_profession",
  "label": "Bomb Disarmament Profession",
  "description": "The profession of bomb disposal experts, also known as EOD (Explosive Ordnance Disposal) technicians, involves the dangerous task of safely neutralizing or disposing of explosive devices. This work is performed by military personnel, law enforcement, and specialized civilian teams. The job requires high levels of technical skill, psychological resilience, and often operates under extreme pressure and life-threatening conditions. The phrase 'a hell of a job' reflects the widely acknowledged danger and stress associated with this profession.",
